d>Fewer communication gaps, clearer RFQ parameters, better launch planning and more consistent packaging quality.</td></tr><tr><th>Core categories</th><td>Custom Gift Boxes, Magnetic Packaging, Rigid Boxes, Mailer Boxes, Paper Bags and accessories.</td></tr><tr><th>MOQ</th><td>500 PCS for custom packaging projects.</td></tr><tr><th>CTA</th><td>Send product size, artwork and destination country for a factory quote.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </section>\n  <section><h2>More than a box supplier</h2><p>Packaging buyers increasingly need a supplier that can discuss positioning, structure, material, finish, sampling, manufacturing and export logistics in one workflow. BestPackFactory is structured around that full process.</p></section>\n<section class=\"rfq-checklist\"><h2>Procurement Checklist</h2><ol><li>Define packaging role: retail display, gifting, shipping or product protection.</li><li>Prepare product dimensions, quantity and launch deadline.</li><li>Choose structure and finish before final artwork.</li><li>Request sample approval before bulk production.</li><li>Confirm export packing and shipping method early.</li></ol></section><section class=\"faq-block\"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>Why is packaging strategy important?</summary><p>It aligns brand positioning, product protection, cost and logistics before production.</p></details><details><summary>Does BestPackFactory only sell boxes?</summary><p>No. The factory supports boxes, bags, labels, bottles, tins, inserts and printed packaging systems.</p></details><details><summary>How can buyers start?</summary><p>Send a brief with product size, quantity, artwork status and target delivery country.</p></details></section><section class=\"rfq-template-box\"><h2>CTA: Ask Lisa for a packaging strategy quote</h2><p>Send product size, target quantity, artwork status, required finish, destination country and launch deadline. BestPackFactory can connect strategy, design, sampling, manufacturing and logistics into one B2B packaging plan.</p><div class=\"rfq-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"../contact.html\">Request Factory Quote</a><a class=\"btn light\" href=\"../products.html\">View Packaging Products</a></div></section><section><h2>Related Pages</h2><ul class=\"internal-links\"><li><a href=\"../blog/custom-gift-boxes-strategy-design-manufacturing-logistics.html\">Custom Gift Boxes Strategy Guide</a></li><li><a href=\"../products.html\">All Products</a></li><li><a href=\"../contact.html\">Contact</a></li></ul></section></main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div>\n<h3>BestPackFactory</h3>\n<p>B2B custom packaging manufacturer for boxes, bags, labels, bottles, tins and printing.</p>\n<p>Lisa Wu · lisa@colorprintingpackage.com · WhatsApp +86 158 8653 0985</p>\n<p>Address: Printing Industrial Park, Longhua District, Shenzhen, Guangdong Province, 518109, China</p>\n</div>\n<div><h3>Products</h3><a href=\"../products.html\">All Products</a><a href=\"../products/luxury-magnetic-boxes.html\">Magnetic Boxes</a><a href=\"../products/flexible-packaging.html\">Flexible Packaging</a><a href=\"../products/paper-bags.html\">Paper Bags</a></div>\n<div><h3>Inquiry</h3><a href=\"../contact.html\">Request Quote</a><a href=\"mailto:lisa@colorprintingpackage.com\">Email Lisa</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat\">\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__head\">Need Custom Packaging?</div>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__body\">\n<strong>MOQ 500 PCS · Fast Factory Quote</strong>\n<p>Click below to contact us quickly by WhatsApp or email. We can help with dieline, samples, printing, materials and worldwide shipping.</p>\n<a class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn--wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985?text=Hello%20BestPackFactory%2C%20I%20need%20a%20custom%20packaging%20quote.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>\n<a class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn bpf-whatsapp-chat